ntion to how the intro art corresponds to the activity's introduction text, such as in the seatbelt activity.\n\n\n**Reviewing Activity Data**\n\nI'm now diving deeper into the specific data for activities 10 through 13. I'm focusing on the dialogue and visual pairings. For instance, activity 10 has the prompt \"Trên máy bay mình nói nhỏ vừa đủ nghe nhé.\" matched with the image of Bin whispering. Similarly, I'm analyzing how intro art and text align for activities 11 (\"Bin thu chân gọn lại để không chạm ghế phía trước nhé!\"), 12 (\"Máy bay đang chạy vào chỗ đỗ. Bin vẫn ngồi yên và giữ dây an toàn nhé!\"), and 13 (\"Con tìm chiếc vali đỏ có hình gấu của Bin nhé!\").\n\n\n**Detailing Activity Gameplay**\n\nI'm now fully immersed in the specifics of activities 4, 7, and 12. Activity 4 involves an X-ray scanner gameplay with objects to identify. I see activity 7 focus on seatbelt fastening using tap interactions. Activity 12 has gameplay centered around waiting for the plane to stop and unbuckling the seatbelt. I am looking into how to make the gameplay intuitive, and the completion feedback engaging.\n\n\n**Refining Activity 12 Gameplay**\n\nI've been working on Activity 12, the landing sequence. The initial state will show Bé Bin with a fastened seatbelt while the plane is still taxiing. The seatbelt release button is disabled, represented by \"⏳ Máy bay đang chạy vào bãi đỗ...\". After 2.6 seconds, the plane stops and the seatbelt sign turns off, enabling the button with \"🔓 Máy bay đã dừng hẳn — Mở dây an toàn\". Upon interaction, the seatbelt opens (\"TÁCH!\") and the visual changes to `bin_seated_plane`. Feedback is given: \"Máy bay dừng hẳn rồi. Bây giờ mình mới mở dây nhé!\" and a \"TIẾP TỤC\" button advances to Activity 13, which is the \"Find the Suitcase\" activity. I'm now examining the integration of completion feedback.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/* ==========================================================================\n   CÙNG BÉ BIN ĐI MÁY BAY - 2D STORYBOOK INTERACTIVE BOOK (13 HOẠT ĐỘNG ĐỘC LẬP)\n   - 8 Chặng lớn (Top Nav) & Tiến trình phụ (Sub-progress) cho từng chặng\n   - Cấu trúc chuẩn: Màn Giới Thiệu (Intro) -> Màn Thực Hiện (Gameplay) -> Phản Hồi\n   - 1 Kỹ năng = 1 Hoạt động riêng biệt\n   - Tối ưu chạm lớn (>=70px), không SpeechSynthesis, giữ Web Audio SFX\n   - Responsive hoàn hảo 1366x768 & 1920x1080 không scroll dọc gameplay\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n:root {\n    --color-sky-blue: #73C7E8;\n    --color-warm-orange: #F5A45D;\n    --color-cream-yellow: #F8D978;\n    --color-soft-green: #82C99A;\n    --color-coral-pink: #EFA49A;\n    --color-suitcase-red: #E75B52;\n    --outline-brown: #514B48;\n    --text-dark: #37474F;\n    --shadow-soft: 0 6px 14px rgba(81, 75, 72, 0.14);\n    --shadow-chunky: 0 6px 0 rgba(81, 75, 72, 0.18), 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n    --radius-round: 9999px;\n    --radius-story: 28px;\n\n    /* Master Family Reference Sprite Sheet */\n    --char-sprite: url('file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/.user_uploaded/media_1787727192577.png');\n}\n\n* {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    user-select: none;\n    -webkit-user-select: none;\n}\n\nbody, html {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    font-family: \"Nunito\", \"Arial Rounded MT Bold\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n    background: #E1F5FE;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    touch-action: manipulation;\n}\n\n#app-root {\n    width: 100vw;\n    height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n#effects-canvas {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    z-index: 1000;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   TẦNG 1: THANH TIẾN TRÌNH (8 CHẶNG LỚN & CỔNG BA MẸ)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.top-nav {\n    height: 52px;\n    padding: 4px 16px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    z-index: 50;\n}\n\n.stage-indicators {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n    border: 2px solid #FFF;\n}\n\n.stage-dot {\n    width: 36px;\n    height: 36px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #ECEFF1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 -3px 0 #CFD8DC;\n    border: none;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.active {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F8D978 0%, #F5A45D 100%);\n    transform: scale(1.18);\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(245, 164, 93, 0.45), inset 0 -3px 0 #E67E22;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.completed {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #A5D6A7 0%, #82C99A 100%);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 -3px 0 #66BB6A;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.locked {\n    opacity: 0.35;\n    cursor: not-allowed;\n    filter: grayscale(0.8);\n}\n\n/* NÚT BẤM STORYBOOK BO TRÒN */\n.tycoon-btn {\n    min-width: 60px;\n    min-height: 44px;\n    padding: 6px 18px;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    box-shadow: 0 5px 0 #CFD8DC, 0 8px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n    transition: all 0.12s ease;\n    touch-action: manipulation;\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn:active:not(:disabled) {\n    transform: translateY(3px);\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #CFD8DC;\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn:disabled {\n    cursor: not-allowed;\n    opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-green {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #82C99A 0%, #66BB6A 100%);\n    color: #1B5E20;\n    box-shadow: 0 5px 0 #43A047, 0 8px 18px rgba(67, 160, 71, 0.3);\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-primary {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F8D978 0%, #F5A45D 100%);\n    color: #5D4037;\n    box-shadow: 0 5px 0 #E67E22, 0 8px 18px rgba(230, 126, 34, 0.3);\n}\n\n/* Cổng Ba Mẹ: Vòng giữ 3 giây */\n.parent-gate-btn {\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.parent-hold-ring {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    transform: rotate(-90deg);\n}\n\n.parent-hold-ring circle {\n    fill: none;\n    stroke: #FF7043;\n    stroke-width: 5;\n    stroke-dasharray: 175;\n    stroke-dashoffset: 175;\n    transition: stroke-dashoffset 0.1s linear;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   TẦNG 2: TIẾN TRÌNH PHỤ (SUB-PROGRESS) & BIỂN BÁO LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ\n   ========================================================================== */\n.parent-prompt-container {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto 4px auto;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n    z-index: 40;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.sub-progress-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n    padding: 2px 14px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #455A64;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n}\n\n.sub-step-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n    opacity: 0.5;\n}\n\n.sub-step-item.active {\n    opacity: 1;\n    color: #E65100;\n    font-weight: 900;\n}\n\n.sub-step-item.completed {\n    opacity: 0.9;\n    color: #2E7D32;\n}\n\n.parent-prompt-signboard {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    padding: 6px 18px;\n    border: 3px solid #FFE082;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #FFCA28, var(--shadow-soft);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite {\n    width: 46px;\n    height: 46px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 3px solid #F5A45D;\n    box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n    background-image: var(--char-sprite);\n    background-repeat: no-repeat;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite.speaker-mom {\n    background-size: 500% auto;\n    background-position: 29.5% 18%;\n    border-color: #EFA49A;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite.speaker-dad {\n    background-size: 500% auto;\n    background-position: 51.5% 18%;\n    border-color: #82C99A;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite.speaker-bin {\n    background-size: 500% auto;\n    background-position: 8.5% 18%;\n    border-color: #F5A45D;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite.speaker-attendant {\n    background-size: 500% auto;\n    background-position: 88.5% 18%;\n    border-color: #00897B;\n}\n\n.prompt-speech-text {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    line-height: 1.3;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   TẦNG 3: VIEWPORT 13 HOẠT ĐỘNG (MÀN GIỚI THIỆU & MÀN THỰC HIỆN)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.screens-viewport {\n    flex: 1;\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: calc(100vh - 120px);\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.activity-container {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    opacity: 0;\n    visibility: hidden;\n    transform: scale(0.98);\n    transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.25, 0.64, 1), visibility 0.3s;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 4px 16px 12px 16px;\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n    background-repeat: no-repeat;\n}\n\n.activity-container.active {\n    opacity: 1;\n    visibility: visible;\n    transform: scale(1);\n}\n\n/* MÀN GIỚI THIỆU HOẠT ĐỘNG (INTRO VIEW) */\n.activity-intro-view {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 820px;\n    height: 88%;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-story);\n    border: 4px solid #FFE082;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 0 #FFCA28, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 14px 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: auto 0;\n    z-index: 10;\n}\n\n.intro-header-badge {\n    background: #E1F5FE;\n    color: #0288D1;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    padding: 4px 14px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    border: 2px solid #B3E5FC;\n}\n\n.intro-activity-title {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #E65100;\n    margin: 2px 0;\n}\n\n.intro-art-frame {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 620px;\n    height: 250px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n    border: 3px solid #FFF;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: #FFF;\n}\n\n.intro-art-frame img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n.intro-prompt-quote {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #37474F;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    padding: 0 10px;\n}\n\n/* MÀN THỰC HIỆN HOẠT ĐỘNG (GAMEPLAY VIEW) */\n.activity-gameplay-view {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n/* OVERLAY PHẢN HỒI HOÀN THÀNH */\n.activity-feedback-overlay {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 16px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);\n    border-radius: 30px;\n    padding: 10px 24px;\n    border: 4px solid #82C99A;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #43A047, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    z-index: 60;\n    animation: popBounce 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.activity-feedback-overlay.hidden {\n    display: none !important;\n}\n\n.feedback-text {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #1B5E20;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   CHARACTER RENDERER\n   ========================================================================== */\n.bin-character-frame {\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.bin-layered-stack {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.bin-character-frame img,\n.bin-layer {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    background: transparent;\n    opacity: 1;\n    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.pop-in-soft {\n    animation: popInSoft 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;\n}\n\n@keyframes popInSoft {\n    0% { transform: scale(0.94); opacity: 0.7; }\n    100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   ACTIVITY 1: WARDROBE\n   ========================================================================== */\n.wardrobe-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 980px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;\n    gap: 24px;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.wardrobe-cabinet-art {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    border: 4px solid #FFE082;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-story);\n    padding: 12px;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile-art {\n    min-height: 90px;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    border: 3px solid #CFD8DC;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #B0BEC5, 0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 6px;\n    cursor: grab;\n    touch-action: none;\n    transition: transform 0.18s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.clothes-tile-art:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.04); }\n.clothes-tile-art:active { cursor: grabbing; transform: scale(1.15); z-index: 100; }\n.clothes-tile-art.shake-wobble {\n    animation: springShake 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.36, 0.07, 0.19, 0.97) both;\n    border-color: #E75B52 !important;\n}\n\n.item-img-art {\n    width: 62px;\n    height: 62px;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.item-label-tag {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    margin-top: 3px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n.bin-character-stage {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.bin-stage-pedestal {\n    width: 260px;\n    height: 380px;\n    background: none;\n    border: none;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.bin-mount-lvl1 {\n    width: 250px;\n    height: 370px;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   ACTIVITY 4: SOI HÀNH LÝ QUA MÁY QUÉT (ĐỘC LẬP)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.xray-focused-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 820px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.xray-scanner-chunky {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 580px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    border-radius: 36px;\n    border: 4px solid #00E676;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #00BFA5, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    padding: 18px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.xray-screen-large {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 140px;\n    background: #00251A;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    border: 4px solid #00E676;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.5);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    padding: 10px;\n}\n\n.xray-box-touch {\n    width: 80px;\n    height: 80px;\n    background: #00E676;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 38px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 14px #00E676;\n    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.xray-box-touch:hover { transform: scale(1.12); }\n.xray-box-touch.revealed { animation: popBounce 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1); }\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   ACTIVITY 7: CÀI DÂY AN TOÀN (ĐỘC LẬP)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.seatbelt-focused-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 24px;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.seat-plush-box {\n    border-radius: 36px;\n    padding: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.bin-mount-lvl5 {\n    width: 220px;\n    height: 270px;\n}\n\n.safety-sign-led {\n    background: #E75B52;\n    color: white;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    padding: 3px 14px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    transition: background 0.3s;\n}\n\n.safety-sign-led.green-safe {\n    background: #43A047;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 16px #00E676;\n}\n\n.seatbelt-puzzle-box {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    border-radius: 28px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n    border: 3px solid #FFE082;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.seatbelt-straps-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    height: 64px;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.strap-left, .strap-right {\n    height: 44px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    cursor: grab;\n    touch-action: none;\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\n}\n\n.strap-left {\n    background: #37474F;\n    width: 85px;\n    border-radius: 8px 0 0 8px;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.buckle-insert {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -16px;\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 28px;\n    background: #B0BEC5;\n    border: 3px solid #78909C;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.strap-right {\n    background: #37474F;\n    width: 85px;\n    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.buckle-receiver {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -16px;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 38px;\n    background: #90A4AE;\n    border: 3px solid #546E7A;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.seatbelt-buckled .strap-left { transform: translateX(16px) !important; }\n.seatbelt-buckled .buckle-receiver { background: #00E676; border-color: #00BFA5; box-shadow: 0 0 16px #00E676; }\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   ACTIVITY 12: CHỜ DỪNG RỒI MỞ DÂY (ĐỘC LẬP)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.unbuckle-focused-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 24px;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.unbuckle-status-card {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    border-radius: 28px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    border: 3px solid #B3E5FC;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   CÁC HOẠT ĐỘNG KHÁC (2, 3, 5, 6, 8, 9, 10, 11, 13)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.suitcase-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 880px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile {\n    width: 110px;\n    height: 90px;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    border: 3px solid #CFD8DC;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #B0BEC5, 0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: grab;\n    touch-action: none;\n    transition: transform 0.18s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n    padding: 6px;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.04); }\n.clothes-tile.shake-wobble { animation: springShake 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.36, 0.07, 0.19, 0.97) both; }\n\n.suitcase-box-red {\n    width: 280px;\n    height: 290px;\n    border-radius: 36px;\n    border: 5px solid #8E0000;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 0 #5f0000, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 12px;\n    position: relative;\n    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.suitcase-inner-grid {\n    width: 100%;\n    flex: 1;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    border: 3px dashed #E75B52;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 8px;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-items: center;\n}\n\n.boarding-pass-chunky {\n    width: 220px;\n    height: 110px;\n    background: #FFF9C4;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    border: 3px dashed #FFB300;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    padding: 12px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.stamp-badge {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-15deg) scale(0);\n    border: 3px solid #43A047;\n    color: #2E7D32;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    opacity: 0;\n    background: #E8F5E9;\n    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.stamp-badge.stamped {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-15deg) scale(1.1);\n    animation: stampSlam 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;\n}\n\n.gate-detector-chunky {\n    width: 160px;\n    height: 220px;\n    border: 14px solid #78909C;\n    border-bottom: none;\n    border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    background: rgba(236, 239, 241, 0.6);\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.gate-lamps-row {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -22px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.gate-lamp-led {\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #CFD8DC;\n    border: 2px solid #546E7A;\n}\n\n.gate-lamp-led.green-flash {\n    background: #00E676;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 16px #00E676;\n    animation: lamp-blink 0.25s alternate 6;\n}\n\n.gates-array-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.gate-pillar {\n    width: 130px;\n    height: 130px;\n    background: #263238;\n    color: #F8D978;\n    border: 4px solid #455A64;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #102027;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-family: monospace;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.gate-pillar.matched {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2E7D32 0%, #1B5E20 100%);\n    border-color: #00E676;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #004D40, 0 0 20px #00E676;\n    animation: popBounce 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.cloud-window-frame {\n    height: 290px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #73C7E8 0%, #B3E5FC 60%, #E1F5FE 100%);\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    border: 12px solid #ECEFF1;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15), 0 10px 0 #CFD8DC, var(--shadow-soft);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    padding: 8px;\n}\n\n.morph-cloud-tile {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);\n    border-radius: 36px;\n    padding: 14px 22px;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    border: 3px solid transparent;\n    transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.morph-cloud-tile.morphed {\n    background: #FFF9C4;\n    border-color: #F8D978;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 20px #F8D978;\n    animation: gentle-bounce 0.6s infinite alternate;\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-options {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-btn {\n    width: 86px;\n    height: 80px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    background: #FFF;\n    border: 3px solid #CFD8DC;\n    box-shadow: 0 5px 0 #B0BEC5;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-btn span { font-size: 28px; line-height: 1; }\n.volume-emotion-btn small { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--text-dark); margin-top: 3px; }\n.volume-emotion-btn.selected {\n    transform: scale(1.12);\n    border-color: #43A047;\n    background: #E8F5E9;\n    box-shadow: 0 5px 0 #2E7D32, 0 0 14px #00E676;\n}\n\n.carousel-track-chunky {\n    width: 90%;\n    height: 150px;\n    border: 14px solid #455A64;\n    border-radius: 75px;\n    background: #ECEFF1;\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.carousel-suitcases-track {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 28px;\n    position: absolute;\n    animation: carousel-orbit 14s linear infinite;\n}\n\n.carousel-suitcases-track.paused { animation-play-state: paused; }\n\n.carousel-bag-tile {\n    width: 76px;\n    height: 86px;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    border: 3px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.golden-medal-modal {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.8);\n    opacity: 0;\n    visibility: hidden;\n    width: 90%;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFDE7 0%, #FFF9C4 100%);\n    border-radius: 36px;\n    border: 6px solid #F8D978;\n    box-shadow: 0 16px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n    padding: 22px;\n    text-align: center;\n    z-index: 200;\n    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.golden-medal-modal.show {\n    opacity: 1;\n    visibility: visible;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1);\n    animation: popBounce 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   CỔNG BA MẸ (PARENT CONTROL HUB)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.parent-modal-overlay {\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100vw;\n    height: 100vh;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n    z-index: 999;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    opacity: 0;\n    visibility: hidden;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.parent-modal-overlay.open { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; }\n\n.parent-control-card {\n    width: 90%;\n    max-width: 540px;\n    max-height: 88vh;\n    overflow-y: auto;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 32px;\n    padding: 22px;\n    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n    border: 4px solid #F5A45D;\n}\n\n.parent-tip-box {\n    background: #FFF3E0;\n    border-left: 4px solid #F5A45D;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    color: #4E342E;\n}\n\n.level-jump-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin: 8px 0;\n}\n\n.jump-btn {\n    padding: 8px;\n    background: #ECEFF1;\n    border: 2px solid #CFD8DC;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: transform 0.15s;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   KEYFRAME ANIMATIONS\n   ========================================================================== */\n@keyframes gentle-bounce { 0% { transform: translateY(0); } 100% { transform: translateY(-6px); } }\n@keyframes springShake {\n    10%, 90% { transform: translate3d(-3px, 0, 0) rotate(-3deg); }\n    20%, 80% { transform: translate3d(4px, 0, 0) rotate(3deg); }\n    30%, 50%, 70% { transform: translate3d(-5px, 0, 0) rotate(-2deg); }\n    40%, 60% { transform: translate3d(5px, 0, 0) rotate(2deg); }\n}\n@keyframes stampSlam {\n    0% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(2.4) rotate(-35deg); opacity: 0; }\n    50% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.95) rotate(-10deg); opacity: 1; }\n    100% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.1) rotate(-15deg); opacity: 1; }\n}\n@keyframes popBounce { 0% { transform: scale(0.8); } 60% { transform: scale(1.18); } 100% { transform: scale(1); } }\n@keyframes lamp-blink { 0% { opacity: 0.3; } 100% { opacity: 1; } }\n@keyframes carousel-orbit { 0% { transform: translateX(0); } 100% { transform: translateX(-380px); } }\n\n.pop-in { animation: popIn 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards; }\n@keyframes popIn { 0% { transform: scale(0.7); opacity: 0; } 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; } }\n.hidden { display: none !important; }\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   RESPONSIVE (1366x768 & 1920x1080)\n   ========================================================================== */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .wardrobe-arena, .seatbelt-focused-arena, .unbuckle-focused-arena, .suitcase-arena {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 10px;\n    }\n    .intro-art-frame { height: 180px; }\n    .activity-intro-view { padding: 10px; }\n    .intro-activity-title { font-size: 18px; }\n}\n","Description":"Cập nhật style.css hỗ trợ kiến trúc 13 hoạt động độc lập (Intro View, Sub-progress, Focused Gameplay, Feedback)","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\css\\style.css","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Update style.css for 13 activities flow"}}]}
