{"step_index":488,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T07:35:15Z","thinking":"**Structuring the Activities**\n\nI'm currently structuring the HTML for the activities. I'm focusing on the `index.html` file, where each of the 13 activities will be contained within a `.activity-container`. This container will be tagged with both `data-act=\"X\"` and `data-stage=\"Y\"`, to allow organization by activity number and stage. Inside each container, I'm setting up `.activity-intro-view`, which leads into the main content.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"vi\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=3.0, user-scalable=yes, viewport-fit=cover\">\n    <title>Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay (13 Hoạt Động Kỹ Năng Độc Lập)</title>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@700;800;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"app-root\">\n        <!-- Canvas Pháo hoa, Sao lấp lánh & Trái tim -->\n        <canvas id=\"effects-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- TẦNG 1: TOP BAR - 8 CHẶNG LỚN & CỔNG BA MẸ -->\n        <header class=\"top-nav\">\n            <nav class=\"stage-indicators\" aria-label=\"Tiến trình 8 chặng chuyến bay\">\n                <button class=\"stage-dot active\" data-stage=\"1\" aria-label=\"Chặng 1: Chuẩn bị trang phục\">👕</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-stage=\"2\" aria-label=\"Chặng 2: Xếp hành lý\">🧳</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-stage=\"3\" aria-label=\"Chặng 3: Kiểm tra an ninh\">🎫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-st